Soldered PCB for round 3. Used stencil to apply solder paste, and placed parts onto the PCB using tweezers. Used reflow oven to solder all SMD components. 

Some joints were soldered together, such as on the buck converter and the micro usb port. These were fixed using flux, solder, and solder wick. Upon final inspection, all connections appeared secure.  

